@MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### 1. OpenAPI v1 Document
GET {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### 2. Fetch the list of active article categories
GET {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/article-category/list
Accept: application/json

### 3. Fetch details of a specific article category by its slug
GET {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/article-category/beauty
Accept: application/json

### 4. Fetch paginated list of Published articles
GET {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/article/list?Page=1&PageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### 5. Fetch a single Published article and its linked gallery photos by slug
GET {{MagizinePublic.Api_HostAddress}}/api/public/article/the-art-of-quiet-luxury
Accept: application/json
